OL,3,GNEWSAUK government to outlaw new North
OL,4,ASea drilling
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK government has moved to ban any
OL,7,Fnew exploration for oil and gas in the
OL,8,FNorth Sea.
OL,10,FThe Energy Independence Bill would
OL,11,Fremove the North Sea Transition
OL,12,FAuthority's ability to grant new oil
OL,13,Fand gas licences.
OL,15,FThe legislation will not affect the
OL,16,Fdecision on whether to allow drilling
OL,17,Fat Rosebank off Shetland - the UK's
OL,18,Flargest known untapped field - which
OL,19,Fwas approved in 2022 before being
OL,20,Fsubject to legal challenges.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
