OL,3,GNEWSAUK government to outlaw new North
OL,4,ASea drilling
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK government said it was upholding
OL,7,FLabour's 2024 manifesto vow not to
OL,8,Fissue licences for new oil and gas
OL,9,Ffields, as well as underpinning its
OL,10,Fcommitment to reducing global warming.
